# Weather Impact Analysis for Agriculture

A production-quality machine learning platform that predicts crop yield from
weather and field conditions, scores environmental risk, simulates climate
scenarios, and explains every prediction with real SHAP values — all from a
single-page Streamlit application backed by a clean Python ML package.

