## Project Structure

```
app.py                              Single-page Streamlit application (entry point)
requirements.txt                    Core dependencies
requirements-dev.txt                Dev/test dependencies

src/weather_impact/
  config/
    settings.py                     All paths, column names, training constants
    crops.py                        Crop profiles: optimal ranges, reference yields
    locations.py                    District coordinate data

  data/
    loader.py                       CSV loading
    cleaning.py                     Validation, outlier removal, type coercion
    validation.py                   Schema checks for prediction inputs
    synthetic.py                    Synthetic dataset generator (seed 42)

  features/
    engineering.py                  Feature engineering: temp_humidity_index,
                                    dist_crop_mean_yield, prepare_features()

  models/
    train.py                        Model training loop (Random Forest + XGBoost)
    evaluate.py                     R², MAE, RMSE, MAPE, WAPE computation
    predict.py                      predict_one(), predict_yield() with enrichment
    registry.py                     save_model(), load_model(), load_metadata()

  risk/
    risk_score.py                   compute_risk() → RiskResult
    thresholds.py                   RISK_WEIGHTS, level boundaries
    recommendations.py              Plain-language advice from RiskResult

  simulation/
    what_if.py                      ScenarioChange, run_what_if(), apply_change()

  explainability/
    shap_explainer.py               explain_prediction(), global_importance()

  optimization/
    resource_optimizer.py           Budget allocation (mitigation actions)

  database/
    db.py                           SQLite connection
    repository.py                   save_scenario(), list_scenarios()

  visualization/
    plots.py                        Plotly figure builders (reusable)

  weather/
    open_meteo.py                   Open-Meteo API client (live weather, unused)

  utils/
    exceptions.py                   Custom exception hierarchy
    logger.py                       Logging setup

data/
  raw/crop_weather_records.csv      Primary dataset (31,365 records)
  raw/district_coords.csv           District lat/lon coordinates
  raw/icrisat_district.csv          ICRISAT district-level data
  raw/nasa_weather_cache.csv        NASA POWER API weather cache
  sample/crop_weather_synthetic.csv Synthetic fallback dataset
  weather_impact.db                 SQLite scenario storage

models/saved/
  yield_model.joblib                Trained pipeline (Random Forest)
  yield_model.json                  Metadata: algorithm, metrics, features, versions

scripts/
  train_model.py                    Train, evaluate, and save the model
  generate_sample_data.py           Regenerate the synthetic dataset
  fetch_nasa_weather.py             Pull weather data from NASA POWER API
  seed_database.py                  Seed the SQLite database with sample scenarios
  convert_icrisat.py                Convert raw ICRISAT CSV to project format
  download_data.py                  General data downloader
  download_era5.py                  ERA5 reanalysis data downloader

notebooks/
  01_eda.ipynb                      Exploratory data analysis
  02_model_training.ipynb           Model training walkthrough
  03_shap_analysis.ipynb            SHAP analysis and visualisation

api/
  main.py                           FastAPI application (future REST API)
  routers/predict.py                POST /predict endpoint
  routers/risk.py                   POST /risk endpoint
  routers/simulate.py               POST /simulate endpoint

docs/
  architecture.md                   System architecture overview
  methodology.md                    Data and modelling methodology
  api.md                            REST API documentation
  user_guide.md                     End-user guide
```

