| Package | Minimum version | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `pytest` | 8.0 | Test runner |
| `ruff` | 0.5 | Linter and formatter |

### Installed versions (last training run)

- scikit-learn 1.9.1
- xgboost 3.4.1
